18. Receipt of blood products within 2 months prior to Inclusion visit;
19. Participants with symptomatic hypotension at Screening visit, whatever the decrease of blood pressure, or asymptomatic postural hypotension defined by a decrease in SBP ≥ 20 mmHg or DBP ≥ 10 mmHg within 3 minutes when changing from the supine to the standing position;
