* Absolute neutrophil count ≥1.5\*10E9/L;
* Platelets ≥100\*10E9/L;
* Hemoglobin ≥9.0 g/dL;
* Albumin (ALB) levels ≥2.8 g/dL;
* Total bilirubin (TBIL)≥1.5 upper limit of normal (ULN)
